# Software industry mapping for MOB
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/mob/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:product_mobile_application owl:equivalentClass sw:ProductMobileApplication .
legacy:product_mobile_application_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:productMobileApplicationId .
legacy:presents_mobile_edition rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:presentsMobileEdition .
